    "formContent": "<div class=\"ielts-form-container\"><div class=\"form-section\"><div class=\"form-title\" style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:1.2em;margin-bottom:10px;\">THE FUTURE OF MANAGEMENT</div><p style=\"font-weight:700;\">Business markets</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; greater <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"31\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> among companies</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; increase in power of large <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"32\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> companies</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; rising <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"33\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> in certain countries</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">External influences on businesses</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; more discussion with <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"34\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> before making business decisions</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; environmental concerns which may lead to more <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"35\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Business structures</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; more teams will be formed to work on a particular <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"36\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; businesses may need to offer hours that are <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"37\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> , or the chance to work remotely</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Management styles</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; increasing need for managers to provide good <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"38\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; changes influenced by <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"39\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> taking senior roles</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Changes in the economy</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; service sector continues to be important</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; increasing value of intellectual property</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; more and more <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"40\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> workers</p></div></div>",
